$ mix install ripgrep
error: this system is NixOS, which already does what `mix` does

note: `mix` has nothing to do here

$ mix explain unsupported-host
UNSUPPORTED_HOST

This system is NixOS.

NixOS manages packages with Nix natively. `mix` exists to bring that to other distributions, so it has nothing to do here.
